{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An issue found when validating a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/missingRequiredParameter(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/missingTagBody(_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/unboundPositionalParameter(_:index:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/unexpectedTagBody(_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/unreadableParameterValue(_:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Enumeration Cases","anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/message"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"content":[{"text":"What is judged here","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"What-is-judged-here"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything a repair cannot reach. "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" rejects what could never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be repaired and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" repairs what it can, but neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"judges: normalization is total, so a defect it could not repair arrives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here intact."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the five are about a tag’s "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"body"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and whether a tag scopes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"something is a fact about the score around it, which no repair could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guess at. The other three are about its "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"parameters"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and each is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value that was written and then thrown away unread."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Why the parameter issues are judged after normalization","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Why-the-parameter-issues-are-judged-after-normalization"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A defect is only definite once every repair has been tried. "},{"code":"\\volta","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requires "},{"code":"mark","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"\\volta<m=\"1.\">","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" supplies it under a name since"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"renamed — so the tag is missing a required parameter as written and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"complete after "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" renames it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The same holds for a "},{"code":"$variable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" that expands into a closed vocabulary,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and for a span end whose written parameters are dropped before they can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overrun its template. This is why "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Error\/notNormalized","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" rather than judging an unnormalized score."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Every issue is fatal","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Every-issue-is-fatal"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no grading, and no issue is advisory. Any of the five leaves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returning the score unvalidated, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a set this small holds nothing worth tolerating: a "},{"code":"\\slur","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" scoping"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing, a "},{"code":"\\title","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" scoping something, and a "},{"code":"\\clef","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with no type are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all defects the writer meant otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Guido renderer warns on every one of the five and draws the score"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anyway. That is a divergence, and a deliberate one — a renderer answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“can something be drawn?”, and this is a library answering “is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"score well formed?”. In each case a value that was written is thrown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"away without being read, and the rendered score says nothing about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loss. What each field "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"means"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is Guido’s to say; what to do about a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"violation is not."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issue"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNValidatorV5IssueO","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","title":"GMNValidator.Issue","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"enum","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issue"}],"extendedModule":"IvorGMN"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnvalidator\/issue"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/GMNValidator":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that validates a Guido Music Notation score."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNValidator"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNValidator"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnvalidator","title":"GMNValidator","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator","kind":"symbol"}